[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    174[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// Rows 30-32 — `circle_collide`: targeted inputs for each bit, multi-bit
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    175[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// overlaps, a dense grid sweep, and a large randomized sweep. Asserts that all
