[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    350[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    351[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// Rows 20 + 21 — `c2Dot` / `c2Mulvs` with `inf * 0` and `inf + (-inf)`, i.e.
