[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    456[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    457[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// Rows 24 + 25 — `c2Clampv` with contradictory bounds (`lo > hi`) and NaN in
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    458[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// any slot. No validation exists, so the result is whatever the nested
